- `/tests/bdd/features/core/` -- 38 Gherkin feature files
- `/tests/bdd/step-definitions/core/` -- 38 step definition files
- `/tests/integration/full-stack.test.ts` -- mocked integration tests
- `/tests/fuzz/parameter-fuzz.test.ts` -- property-based fuzz tests
